---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 3,
  title: 'Day 3',
  date: '2026-09-08',
  description: 'Third day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today(i did my mindfulness habits), I did some great things, I learn
          how to change switches in keyboard, It's easier than I thought
          espectially with keyboard like mine, I decided to learn that, becouse
          I'll start studies in next month and my keyboard is too loud, so I
          bought silent switches and learnt how to change it by myself, I also
          bougth a new Ipad Air M3 , hardened glass, case , case for the case
          and apple pencil pro, It take me some time of the day + I had a
          badminton training , so I couldn't read whole book, I think It'd be
          impossible even if I'd spent full day only reading this , but I read
          part of the book, I learn a lot of new words, that I won't use in
          English converstarion , I'm not sure if I use these word even in
          Polish, but who knows meybe i should start. Also my friends recommend
          me an app named "Tikrow" , It allows you to work for a one specyfic
          day that you choose and the same day you recive payment for the work
          you did. tomorrow I'm going to work so I will write about audiobook
          I'll listen
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll wake up early. I'll make my bed. I'll drink glass of water (my
        habbits from mindfulness), I'll read part of book "think faster, talk
        smarter",I'll go to work and I'll listen audiobooks, I'll find audiobook
        to listen, and wrote blog about this
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 5/10, I didn't do what i planned, but it was unreal, apart
          of that I think it wasn't that bad day
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DayRating class="w-full" rating={5} />
  </article>
</Layout>
